deft youtube - commands (input -> output)
  info       url -> report  Title, duration, channel, chapters, qualities [net]
  audio      url -> audio   Save only the sound: --to mp3|m4a|opus [net]
  download   url -> video   Save a video: --resolution 720p, --to mp4|webm|mkv [net]
  playlist   url -> report  List the videos of a playlist or channel [net]
  subtitles  url -> text    Transcript: --lang en,zh --to md|txt|srt|vtt [net]
  thumbnail  url -> image   Save the cover image [net]
More: deft youtube <command> --help
